**Definition (`evalFin`).** The finite state set reached after reading a word is obtained by folding the finite transition operation from the finite start set.

**Definition (`subsetB`).** The set subset b consists exactly of the elements admitted by its defining membership condition.

**Definition (`interEqB`).** Language equality is tested by checking inclusion in both directions.

